OL,3,AHarry and Meghan change children's
OL,4,Aschool over security concerns due to
OL,5,Atraffic
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex have
OL,8,Fchanged their children's school only
OL,9,Fdays after they first started over
OL,10,Fsecurity concerns about traffic during
OL,11,Fthe school run.
OL,13,FThe schools' names have not been
OL,14,Fdisclosed, but it is understood that
OL,15,Fthe Sussexes' private security team had
OL,16,Fbeen concerned that the distance and
OL,17,Fthe heavy traffic on the original
OL,18,Fschool run route had made it difficult
OL,19,Fto make secure.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
