OL,3,AHarry and Meghan change children's
OL,4,Aschool over security concerns due to
OL,5,Atraffic
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's understood that the security for
OL,8,Fthe children meant travelling with
OL,9,Fanother car, and that driving in convoy
OL,10,Fproved difficult in the busy school run
OL,11,Ftraffic.
OL,13,FThe checks on the route are believed to
OL,14,Fhave initially taken place before term
OL,15,Ftime, but with the school traffic it
OL,16,Fwas deemed not safe enough.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
